foreign exchange, prepaid forex cards, cross-border remittances and related financial services. The company allows travelers to research, plan, and book a range of travel services and products in India and internationally through its primary websites, including makemytrip.com, goibibo.com, redbus.in, and makemytrip.ae; and other technology-enhanced distribution channels, such as call centers, franchisee-owned travel stores, and travel agents' network, as well as its mobile applications. It primarily serves leisure travelers and corporates. The company was formerly known as International Web Travel Private Limited and changed its name to MakeMyTrip Limited in March 2010. MakeMyTrip Limited was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Gurugram, India.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"4700","sic_desc":"Transportation Services","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","mcap":4196897536,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"GURGAON, India","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"0331","cik":1495153,"state_inc":"O4","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"Yahoo quarterly income statement via yfinance (third-party fallback)","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":268846000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.22,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":25924000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":9.6,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-09-30","rev":229341000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.06,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":-5615000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":-2.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-12-31","rev":295688000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.07,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":7247000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":2.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2026-03-31","rev":250116000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.02,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":24248000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":9.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2026-06-30","rev":285579000.0,"rev_yoy":6.2,"eps":0.09,"eps_yoy":-59.1,